{
  "slug": "speakai",
  "name": "Speakai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Search transcripts, summarize meetings, extract quotes, create clips, and manage Speak AI media through MCP.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `automations-and-webhooks` (Build, test, and operate Speak AI automations and webhooks through MCP), `clips-and-captions` (Turn Speak AI recordings into shareable output), `getting-started` (Connect an agent to Speak AI and orient it in the workspace), `meeting-summaries` (Turn meetings recorded in Speak AI into decisions, action items, owners, and risks), `research-analysis` (Analyze interviews, user research calls, and customer conversations across many Speak AI recordings)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `speakai`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install speakai@claude-community` from `speakai/speakai-mcp` (`plugins/speakai-mcp`).",
